                                                "sense_id": "fbd1794e-2141-324a-b0bc-d92d3cb2ee5d",
                                                "text": "So much to do, so much to see\nSo what's wrong with taking the back streets?\nYou'll never know if you don't go\nYou'll never shine if you don't glow"
